        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk programme printed on double cream silk in blue and pink typography. Gilt fringe applied all round with four tassels, one at each corner. Produced for 'The Bal Masque', 'Quick March', 'The Craggs', 'La Belle Siffleuse', 'Wilton and Mora', 'Paul Cinquevalli', 'Galatea', and 'Cleopatra', Empire Theatre of Varieties, 4 July 1889."@en ;
